Hi all, I'm very interested in the new indexes M and AR, however I'm not able to find help on the needed parameters and their meaning ... For AR I only get the list of parameters, but for M, nothing...

Is there any biblio ref to these indices ?

I also take the opportunity to ask:  which is your reccomended R interpreter and GUI to get faster computation on sampled signals ? also, do you reccomend any specific solution to parallelize computations to get advantage from multicore cpus ?
(the computation of the available indexes at different time scales (1 to 10 minutes) takes a huge amount of time .... in my case 2000 stereo files at 48 kHz 10 minutes long take about 12 days of computation to produce a matrix of indexes at 1 minute and 10 minutes resolution)

Gianni Pavan

